    "usability_domain": [
        "This workflow performs machine-learning classification on the GSE74777 gene-expression dataset. The expression matrix is loaded into a pandas dataframe, gene identifiers contained in the ID_REF column are assigned as the dataframe index, and the matrix is transposed so that rows represent samples and columns represent genes. Temporary binary responder labels are generated randomly for the samples. The resulting features are standardized using StandardScaler and reduced to 20 principal components using PCA. The processed dataset is divided into training and testing subsets using a 75/25 split with random_state=123. A RandomForestClassifier with random_state=123 is trained on the training data. Model performance is evaluated using training and testing accuracy, a confusion matrix, a classification report, and an ROC curve with AUC."
    ],

